.0,243449.0],[151860.0,247342.0],[149983.0,250242.0],[149720.0,252463.0],[147251.0,254379.0],[145445.0,255725.0],[143767.0,257285.0],[142365.0,256743.0],[139904.0,255024.0],[137559.0,253666.0],[135040.0,251654.0],[133158.0,251311.0],[130628.0,247996.0],[127453.0,245534.0],[124310.0,244231.0],[120770.0,243285.0],[117858.0,242076.0],[115893.0,242738.0],[116524.0,237927.0],[117896.0,235137.0],[118479.0,233993.0],[123370.0,231191.0],[127154.0,230054.0],[131229.0,231191.0],[134934.0,232364.0],[137830.0,233704.0],[141628.0,237002.0],[146209.0,240912.0],[149127.0,241205.0],[151387.0,242652.0],[152206.0,243449.0],[151860.0,247342.0],[149983.0,250242.0],[149720.0,252463.0],[147251.0,254379.0],[145445.0,255725.0],[143767.0,257285.0],[142365.0,256743.0],[139904.0,255024.0],[137559.0,253666.0]]}},"meta":{"created":"2026-08-19","name":"Uran","version":1},"missions":[{"briefing":{"briefing":"19 November 1942, 08:40. Operation Uran opens this morning in fog and blowing snow north-west of the city. While the guns work, II./St.G.2 is putting Stukas onto the Volga crossing at Rynok - the artery feeding 62nd Army in the factory district. 27 IAP is to be over Rynok at 2500 m and break up the attack before it reaches the ferries. Escort is expected: a Rotte of Bf 109 F-4 from II./JG52 out of Tuzov. Two paras. Cold start. Watch your throttle in this air - it is minus eighteen on the deck.","name":"01 - Frost and Smoke","objective_detail":"Destroy at least three of the six Ju 87 D-3 before they reach the crossing.","objective_short":"Break up the attack on Rynok","series":"Uran series - Stalingrad co-op","target_name":"Rynok crossing"},"coalition":1,"date":"1942-11-19","failure_obj_id":null,"id":"01_Frost_and_Smoke","log_sets_applied":[],"result":null,"sector":"rynok_crossing","status":"pending","success_obj_id":68,"turn":0},{"briefing":{"briefing":"21 November 1942, 10:15. The pincers are closing. Sixth Army's rear-area units are streaming west along the Marinovka road toward the Don crossing at Kalach, and 8th Air Army wants that road cut before dark. Each aircraft carries two FAB-50 under the wings. Make one pass with the bombs, then work the column with guns - but be quick about it: there is 2 cm flak on the halftracks, and a Rotte of Bf 109 G-2 has been reported over the road most of the morning. Bombs are on the release you use for rockets. Two paras. Cold start.","name":"02 - Hammer at Marinovka","objective_detail":"Destroy at least five vehicles of the withdrawing column.","objective_short":"Cut the Marinovka road","series":"Uran series - Stalingrad co-op","target_name":"Marinovka road"},"coalition":1,"date":"1942-11-20","failure_obj_id":null,"id":"02_Hammer_at_Marinovka","log_sets_applied":[],"result":null,"sector":"marinovka_road","status":"pending","success_obj_id":77,"turn":0},{"briefing":{"briefing":"22 November 1942, 09:00. Sixth Army is being pressed back into the steppe west of the city and Gumrak has become its main forward field. 65th ShAP is sending a shestyorka of Il-2 against the dispersals; 27 IAP provides close escort. The Sturmoviks will form up over Pichuga as you climb out - stay with them. I./JG3 'Udet' is at Golubinskiy and they are good. Do not chase. If you leave the Il-2 to go hunting, they will be shot down behind you. Yak-1 today. Two paras. Cold start.","name":"03 - Sturmoviks","objective_detail":"The Il-2 of 65th ShAP must complete their attack on Gumrak.","objective_short":"Bring the Sturmoviks home","series":"Uran series - Stalingrad co-op","target_name":"Gumrak"},"coalition":1,"date":"1942-11-21","failure_obj_id":null,"id":"03_Sturmoviks","log_sets_applied":[],"result":null,"sector":"gumrak","status":"pending","success_obj_id":38,"turn":0},{"briefing":{"briefing":"25 November 1942, 13:00. The ring closed at Kalach two days ago. Sixth Army is inside it, and this morning the first transports came in from the Don airfields to Pitomnik. Goering has promised three hundred tons a day. 8th Air Army intends that he does not deliver it. This is a free hunt: no bombers to shepherd, no ground target, no schedule but the enemy's. A Kette of Ju 52 is inbound from the west-south-west at about 1500 m with a pair of Bf 109 F-4 somewhere above them. Find them before Pitomnik does. Yak-1. Two paras. Cold start.","name":"04 - The Airlift","objective_detail":"Destroy at least three of the six Ju 52 before they reach Pitomnik.","objective_short":"Break the airlift","series":"Uran series - Stalingrad co-op","target_name":"Transport track"},"coalition":1,"date":"1942-11-23","failure_obj_id":null,"id":"04_The_Airlift","log_sets_applied":[],"result":null,"sector":"pitomnik_airlift","status":"pending","success_obj_id":79,"turn":0}],"pilots":{"olorin":{"callsign_names_seen":["CANARY_Olorin"],"deaths":0,"display_name":"Olorin","kills":0,"login_uuids":[],"missions_flown":0,"side":"VVS","sorties":[],"status":"active","times_downed":0},"sloan":{"callsign_names_seen":["CANARY_Sloan"],"deaths":0,"display_name":"Sloan","kills":0,"login_uuids":[],"missions_flown":0,"side":"VVS","sorties":[],"status":"active","times_downed":0}},"sectors":{"gumrak":{"history":[],"pos":[140447.0,241957.0],"pressure":0},"marinovka_road":{"history":[],"pos":[131485.143,203755.0],"pressure":0},"pitomnik_airlift":{"history":[],"pos":[136113.0,233191.0],"pressure":0},"rynok_crossing":{"history":[],"pos":[144115.0,259940.0],"pressure":0}},"story":[{"date":"1942-11-19","text":"Before dawn on 19 November 1942, Soviet artillery opened along the Don front north-west of Stalingrad. Operation Uran had begun: the counteroffensive meant to encircle the German Sixth Army in the city it could not take. 27th Fighter Air Regiment, based at Pichuga on the east bank of the Volga, flew top cover and interdiction over the crossings and roads that would decide whether the pincers closed. What follows is their war.","title":"Uran","turn":0}],"theaters":{"stalingrad":{"active":true,"display_name":"Stalingrad","frontline_dates":["1942-03-01","1942-08-01","1942-09-06","1942-10-11","1942-11-23","1942-12-23","1943-01-20"],"map_key":"stalingrad-winter"}}}